    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": ""
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Pierce Anamatar.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 2 as a spellcaster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Man Who Sells The Way Out</strong> — His own. Operates inside Mages' Guild ground and says plainly that he dislikes the Guild</p><p>Status: Active — holds a den off the Skittering Grove; contracted to kill the Oracle; now holds Remi Akamatsu's student ID</p><p>A man with knights, a den, and a price list. Pierce Anamatar has appeared twice now in the same role: somebody cornered meets him, and he offers passage in exchange for a possession. On a Shadow Estate rooftop he took a contract to kill the Oracle in exchange for sending the party home. In the burning Skittering Grove he asked for the siglet, settled for a fourteen-year-old's student ID, and called it durable. He does not want coin. He wants things that belong to people.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Dagger</strong> — “[Remi](https://mikegent01.github.io/bik/index.html#/article/remiakamatsufullbackstory) offered him two daggers, one of which she had taken from a fallen stranger because she needed a weapon.”</li><li><strong>Fire Magic</strong> — “In the burning Skittering Grove he asked for the siglet, settled for a fourteen-year-old's student ID, and called it durable.”</li><li><strong>Guild Spellcasting</strong> — “Operates inside Mages' Guild ground and says plainly that he dislikes the Guild”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/pierce_anamatar</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/pierce_anamatar</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
